    "text": "Yes. First, let's connect the laptop to the wireless network. The internet is working, and I can open the club website in the browser.\n\nNo, this is a practice account. The username is printed on the lesson card, and the password is on a separate card. We will remove both cards after practice.\n\nMaybe. Press this small button underneath it first. If the mouse is switched off, the pointer does not move. There, it works now.\n\nOpen the one called Agenda Practice. Then add Friday's start time, which is six thirty. Before you save it, check that the room is number twelve.\n\nYes, but use the practice area, not the real members' area. After you upload it, check that its name appears on the page.\n\nOf course. You do not need to install any new software for this form. The center staff update the program when necessary.\n\nWait until we check the real agenda tomorrow. For now, use the logout button before leaving the computer. Online notes can be useful, but we need to check them carefully.",
